{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quadra Break is a game crafted to help you unwind. With a variety of gameplay modes, it\u2019s all about delivering a soothing and enjoyable experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668530/extras/brain_massage.png?t=1747710928\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668530/extras/color_clear.gif?t=1747710928\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We\u2019ve retained the authentic feel and mechanics, letting you relive the nostalgia while mastering advanced moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668530/extras/classic.png?t=1747710928\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668530/extras/tspin.gif?t=1747710928\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With additional modes, our focus is on easing your mind and providing a true brain massage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668530/extras/various_modes.png?t=1747710928\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668530/extras/drilling_all_clear.gif?t=1747710928\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Invite your friends for online or offline play, whether cooperative or competitive. Share enjoyable moments together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668530/extras/play_together.png?t=1747710928\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668530/extras/duel_40line.gif?t=1747710928\" />